Package: seirvax
Title: SEIR Model with Hospitalisation, Death and Vaccination for Preparedness Exercises
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gunnar", "Rø", email = "gunnarroe@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deterministic (ODE) and stochastic (tau-leaping) SEIR models with
    hospitalisation, community and hospital deaths, and a parallel vaccinated
    stratum, stratified by age group and region. Models are written in odin2
    and run with dust2; simple R wrappers build, run, summarise and plot them.
